\"%s/%s\" % [char_stats.mana, char_stats.max_mana]\n```\n\n---\n\n### `scripts/` directory:\n\nThe `/workspace/scripts/` directory exists but contains **no `.gd` files**. It is empty.\n\n---\n\n## 3. `/workspace/task_config.json`\n```json\n{\n  \"instruction\": \"Finish the card dragging mechanic for the alternate harness. The provided `res://scenes/main.tscn` harness keeps three `CardUI` instances under `OverlayUI/Rack`, and each card should continue using the existing `CardStateMachine`, `CardBaseState`, `CardClickedState`, and `CardDraggingState` nodes from `res://scenes/card_ui/card_ui.tscn`. In `res://scenes/card_ui/card_state_machine.gd`, initialize every child state, connect each state's `transition_requested` signal, enter the exported `initial_state`, and forward `_input` and `gui_input` to the active state while ignoring transition requests that do not come from the current state. In `res://scenes/card_ui/card_ui.gd`, call `card_state_machine.init(self)` in `_ready()`, forward the existing input callbacks into the state machine, and keep `targets` updated from the `DropPointDetector` area enter/exit callbacks without duplicates. In the card state scripts, make the base state emit `reparent_requested`, reset `DropPointDetector.monitoring` to `false`, and move to the clicked state on left-click, make the clicked state record `original_index`, enable `DropPointDetector.monitoring`, and transition to dragging on mouse motion, make the dragging state reparent the card into the node in the `card_layer` group, follow the mouse, cancel back to base on right-click, and only confirm release after `DRAG_MINIMUM_THRESHOLD := 0.08` has elapsed, and make the released state immediately remove the card when `targets` is not empty but otherwise go back to base on the next input. In `res://scenes/ui/hand.gd`, connect each new card's `reparent_requested` signal and restore cancelled drags back into `Rack` at their recorded index.\"\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## 4. `/workspace/scenes/main.tscn`\n```\n[gd_scene load_steps=3 format=3]\n\n[ext_resource type=\"Script\" path=\"res://scenes/main.gd\" id=\"1_main_script\"]\n[ext_resource type=\"Script\" path=\"res://scenes/ui/hand.gd\" id=\"2_hand_script\"]\n\n[sub_resource type=\"RectangleShape2D\" id=\"RectangleShape2D_drop_area\"]\nsize = Vector2(248, 108)\n\n[node name=\"Main\" type=\"Node2D\"]\nscript = ExtResource(\"1_main_script\")\n\n[node name=\"ResolveArea\" type=\"Area2D\" parent=\".\"]\ncollision_layer = 2\n\n[node name=\"CollisionShape2D\" type=\"CollisionShape2D\" parent=\"ResolveArea\"]\nposition = Vector2(124, 54)\nshape = SubResource(\"RectangleShape2D_drop_area\")\n\n[node name=\"OverlayUI\" type=\"CanvasLayer\" parent=\".\" groups=[\"card_layer\"]]\n\n[node name=\"Rack\" type=\"HBoxContainer\" parent=\"OverlayUI\"]\nanchors_preset = 7\nanchor_left = 0.5\nanchor_top = 1.0\nanchor_right = 0.5\nanchor_bottom = 1.0\noffset_left = -75.0\noffset_top = -30.0\noffset_right = 75.0\ngrow_horizontal = 2\ngrow_vertical = 0\nalignment = 1\nscript = ExtResource(\"2_hand_script\")\n```\n\n---\n\n## 5. `/workspace/project.godot`\n```ini\n; Engine configuration file.\n; It's best edited using the editor UI and not directly,\n; since the parameters that go here are not all obvious.\n;\n; Format:\n;   [section] ; section goes between []\n;   param=value ; assign values to parameters\n\nconfig_version=5\n\n[application]\n\nconfig/name=\"Card Dragging Task\"\nrun/main_scene=\"res://scenes/main.tscn\"\nconfig/features=PackedStringArray(\"4.2\")\nconfig/icon=\"res://icon.png\"\n\n[display]\n\nwindow/size/viewport_width=256\nwindow/size/viewport_height=144\nwindow/size/window_width_override=1280\nwindow/size/window_height_override=720\nwindow/stretch/mode=\"viewport\"\n\n[input]\n\nleft_mouse={\n\"deadzone\": 0.5,\n\"events\": [Object(InputEventMouseButton,\"resource_local_to_scene\":false,\"resource_name\":\"\",\"device\":-1,\"window_id\":0,\"alt_pressed\":false,\"shift_pressed\":false,\"ctrl_pressed\":false,\"meta_pressed\":false,\"button_mask\":0,\"position\":Vector2(0, 0),\"global_position\":Vector2(0, 0),\"factor\":1.0,\"button_index\":1,\"canceled\":false,\"pressed\":false,\"double_click\":false,\"script\":null)\n]\n}\nright_mouse={\n\"deadzone\": 0.5,\n\"events\": [Object(InputEventMouseButton,\"resource_local_to_scene\":false,\"resource_name\":\"\",\"device\":-1,\"window_id\":0,\"alt_pressed\":false,\"shift_pressed\":false,\"ctrl_pressed\":false,\"meta_pressed\":false,\"button_mask\":0,\"position\":Vector2(0, 0),\"global_position\":Vector2(0, 0),\"factor\":1.0,\"button_index\":2,\"canceled\":false,\"pressed\":false,\"double_click\":false,\"script\":null)\n]\n}\n\n[layer_names]\n\n2d_physics/layer_1=\"card_target_selector\"\n2d_physics/layer_2=\"card_drop_area\"\n\n[rendering]\n\ntextures/canvas_textures/default_texture_filter=0\nrenderer/rendering_method=\"mobile\"\n```\n\n---\n\nThat is the complete, verbatim contents of every file you requested. The `scripts/` directory at `/workspace/scripts/` exists but is empty (no `.gd` files whatsoever). All `.gd` files in `scenes/card_ui/`, `scenes/` (including subdirectories `battle/`, `card_target_selector/`, `enemy/`, `player/`, and `ui/`), along with `task_config.json`, `scenes/main.tscn`, and `project.godot` have been provided in full above.\n</task_result>\n</task>","metadata":{"parentSessionId":"ses_f21742d7fffeGaDuNj62Je3Pji","sessionId":"ses_f21738715ffe9OiK1RaBwUw6rZ","model":{"modelID":"deepseek-v4-pro","providerID":"openai"},"truncated":false},"title":"Explore project structure","time":{"start":1790440143085,"end":1790440396908}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_73de852e-b1ef-4316-9417-2d724fc344df"}},"id":"prt_0de8c78e3001334TlmQmgGKBFH","sessionID":"ses_f21742d7fffeGaDuNj62Je3Pji","messageID":"msg_0de8c29d4001G0oI62Wu19P3op"}}
